# Dependency Updates

- Add or update dependency versions only in `gradle/libs.versions.toml`.
- Prefer bundles for repeated dependency groups.
- Keep Gradle convention plugins in `build-logic` as the place for shared module defaults.
- After updates, run the narrow affected build first, then `./gradlew productionArchitectureCheck`.
- For Kotlin, Compose, AGP, KSP/KAPT, Room, Koin, Sentry, Media3, and Ktor updates, verify Android compile tasks because these dependencies affect generated code or runtime startup.
- Do not introduce a new DI, navigation, networking, image, or database library without documenting why existing project choices are insufficient.

